Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:28.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,A stepbrother is essentially a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:37.97,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And that's perfectly normal, because even \Nif we suddenly become siblings one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:42.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,we have no shared experience \Nliving together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:53.43,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,My Little Sister and I Are In Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:58.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,A stepsister is essentially a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:01.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Novels and movies like to indulge
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,in the idea that because they \Naren't related by blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:08.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,that they can simply fall in love and \Nhave a normal male-female relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:14.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But things that happen in fiction and things \Nthat happen in real life are very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:21.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,People say that all siblings begin as strangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:26.08,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,but in the case of step-siblings, \Nthey start off as strangers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:28.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,and stay strangers until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:49.70,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Days with My Stepsister
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:53.30,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Episode 1: I'm Home with a Stranger
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:53.09,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Guess what. I've decided to remarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:54.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:58.05,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,She's a girl who worked at \Na bar my boss took me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:01.11,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,She took care of me when I was dead drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:03.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That sounds like a scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:07.56,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Akiko-san \Nisn't like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:11.38,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,You'll see that when you \Nmeet her tonight, Yuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:13.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:14.64,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:17.00,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet up after your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Another rash decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.30,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.30,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are you ready for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:34.27,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:36.32,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,What's that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:39.57,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Too hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,As long as it makes you \Nhappy, I'm fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll just keep doing my usual thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.03,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Your usual thing won't cut it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have a new little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:51.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,A little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:53.05,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah, a little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.03,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Akiko-san's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:08.20,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you. I'm Ayase Akiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.48,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming out. I know \Nyou're busy at your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm the son, Asamura Yuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.24,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Go ahead and introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:23.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ayase Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:26.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:28.21,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:31.85,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Saki-chan is actually \Nthe same age as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.90,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,She's seventeen this year. \NSecond year in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:38.72,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,But your birthday is a week before hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:41.70,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I do apologize for the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:46.01,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Now that she's older, Saki just won't \Nlet me take any pictures of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:50.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just the way I look, \Nbut I'm not very photogenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:55.77,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I'm actually pretty relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:56.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:00.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Since we're going to start living together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried you might be a scary guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:06.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly scary people often look very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I hear you work almost every \Nday to save up for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.43,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And that you get really good grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:20.31,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,A lot of criminals are \Nactually quite intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:31.24,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Hey, before my mom and your dad come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something I want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:35.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Something you don't want them to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:39.85,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah. Or more specifically, \Nsomething I can only say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:44.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did I really earn your trust \Nover such a brief time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:54.64,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That sense of humor, the way \Nyou talk, the way you act...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:58.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,none of those things come \Noff as really intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So I thought maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd be able to truly \Nunderstand what I'm about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:20.41,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't expect anything from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't want you to expect \Nanything from me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.82,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You really do understand what I mean by that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:39.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm totally relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:53.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:07:00.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's maintain this kind of stance \Ngoing forward, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.74,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yuta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the spray?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:21.53,On Top,text,0,0,0,,June 7 (Sunday)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The one for odors?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:17.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's next to the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You left it there after using \Nit on the curtain yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.93,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Oh, I did? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.35,0:07:25.29,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:28.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why are you acting so nervous at this point?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:33.72,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Well, I put off cleaning the bedroom, \Nbut once I started I began to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.57,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,It'd be a real downer if \Nshe tells me it stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:37.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're so sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:41.00,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Hey, when you're my age, this sort \Nof thing is a critical issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:44.57,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:45.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:54.24,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I brought a few things to say \Nthank you for your hospitality!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:59.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:04.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,My mom can never say no, so she bought \Neverything that they recommended to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.95,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Hold on, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it sound like \NI'm a failure as an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:10.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But it's true, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:15.00,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Hmm, what a lovely citrus scent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:17.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You actually keep things pretty clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We've spent the last few \Ndays cleaning like—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.85,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It's just like Taishi-san told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.85,0:08:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are very neat and tidy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.86,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,They say that to develop a healthy mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you must first develop a healthy environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:34.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Cleaning to eliminate every last speck \Nof dust is an Asamura family tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sounds like a kind of ominous \Nfamily tradition to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.43,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Taishi-san is such an impressive man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:43.00,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm okay. I can do this. Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.37,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Hey! Akiko-san! Saki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:51.70,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Welcome to our humble home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:57.76,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,F-From now on, let's all live \Nhappily under the same roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:10.14,On Top,text,0,0,0,,Asamura / Ayase
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:08.82,Default,Akiko & Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:13.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:17.03,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We've prepared a bed and curtains for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:21.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,but weren't sure what colors you like, \Nso we can change them if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We placed the desk near the window for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.11,0:09:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to move it, please let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:33.42,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I think it's quite average.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:38.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,My old place was a worn-out apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One six-tatami room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:42.38,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't even have my own bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:43.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So did you both put down futons and \Nsleep in the same room... perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:52.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No. My mom worked at night, so we \Nwere living on opposite schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:54.44,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,When I slept, I had the place to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure that was \Ncomfortable in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:03.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I apologize that you now have \Nto share a home with two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't care about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:10.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:12.33,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:14.96,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Why are you talking so polite to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:18.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why? Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:22.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We're the same age, so why \Ncan't you loosen up a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:25.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It might be exactly because \Nwe're the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:29.60,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I mean, if you're talking \Nto classmates and friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.44,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,isn't it weird to talk that \Nformally all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:34.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Maybe from a winner's point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:36.84,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:40.68,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not in any position to criticize you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you're just trying to be nice to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.72,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't need that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:49.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's not exactly what I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:58.19,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But this seems like something we should \Nbe absolutely clear on, so I'll ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:03.81,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,would you actually prefer that I \Ndrop the formal language with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:10.56,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah. To be honest, I think casual \Ntalk is a lot more relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:15.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not really someone who deserves \Nthat much respect anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:18.35,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:20.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Then I'll drop the formalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.19,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Just like that, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:27.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It might be tough for me to treat \Nyou the same as a close friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:30.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,but I appreciate you being real \Nwith me and keeping things simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.33,0:11:32.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's easier for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:34.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:44.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's kind of a big help if we can \Nsmooth things out this easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.24,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Smooth things out, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:52.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,When I talked to my friends about \Nthis at school, they laughed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:56.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,"What is that, some kind of contract?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't take me seriously at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:01.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That must've been tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:03.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So I cut ties with all but one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.36,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I only cut off people who weren't \Nworth keeping around anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.88,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I can't read their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they never make any \Neffort to try to tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:21.06,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I can't go tiptoeing around \Ntheir feelings all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:29.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Want some help unloading your luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.84,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That's really kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.73,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Asamura / Ayase
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:05.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:09.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san, do you go to Suisei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:10.84,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:15.04,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Are you surprised that a flashy \Ngirl like me goes to prep school?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:16.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I go there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.70,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You don't have anything to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:31.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But at school, I'll do my best \Nto pretend I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:44.19,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Then again, it might actually be better \Nfor you if we do that, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:52.11,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Just answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me if \Nyou talk on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:57.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:02.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:04.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:10.17,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:14.96,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Staff Asamura
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.69,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hey there, my junior coworker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:18.34,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Staff Yomiuri
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:19.24,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I noticed that you've been \Nsmelling of girl all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:19.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:22.37,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Did you get a girlfriend or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:24.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But do I really smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:28.70,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:32.65,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,How much snuggling would it take \Nto pick up that much of an odor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:34.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think I should be leaving early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:37.35,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Aww, I didn't mean it! \NDon't leave me here alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:41.86,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I was just kidding anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:45.38,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You told me before, right? \NAbout your new little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.56,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I figured she must have moved in by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And... so? Is she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:52.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She's actually... quite beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:54.44,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.80,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Living with a beautiful woman, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the springtime of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.31,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Not a thing is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:02.91,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Something naughty might happen though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:06.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You have a habit of blurting \Nout bad dad jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:12.16,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,After going to an all-girls middle school, \Nhigh school, and college, I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:15.91,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What an awful way to slander girls' schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:19.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it isn't really the time for me to \Nbe entertaining thoughts like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:23.91,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:25.87,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It stresses me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to act \Nas brother and sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:35.69,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well for you, junior, it's probably \Nbest if you just act naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:38.32,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:05.37,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:07.54,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:09.82,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Ah... Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:13.34,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's really said "I'm home" to me before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:21.07,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,so I wasn't sure how to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.59,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You've got a serious look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:31.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I was treated \Nreally badly or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:46.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,My mom would come home when I was at \Nschool to sleep and do housework,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.85,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,and she'd be at work by the time I got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That was just our normal routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:59.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It seemed like you two get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:03.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh. Well, we are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.83,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Today we went shopping for the \Nfirst time in a long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:15.52,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:19.17,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You haven't taken a bath yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:20.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.76,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Who should go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.28,Italics,bath control panel,0,0,0,,The bath is now filling with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:19.60,Italics,bath control panel,0,0,0,,The water temperature has been changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:47.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:50.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The bath is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.27,0:21:01.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good night, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:03.82,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:38.18,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Days with My Stepsister
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.25,0:23:08.03,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:23.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.55,0:23:49.99,On Top,Sign,0,0,0,,Episode 2: A Deal and a Fried Egg
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
